@startuml

start

:Avionics stack (FMS/FADEC) executes on RTOS;

fork
:High-frequency ISR-driven sensor samples;
fork again
:Lower-priority worker tasks;
end fork

:Realize control law computations;

:Dedicated telemetry monitor operates within periodic timer-interrupt loop;
:Perform multi-stage validation of flight data;

:Source legitimacy;
:Format correctness;
:Data completeness;
:Logical consistency;

if (Detect anomaly?) then (yes)
  :Initiate root-cause investigation;
  if (Fail?) then (yes)
    :Log structured audit event to ring buffer;
    :Trigger automatic data retransmission mechanism;
    repeat
    :Operations managed by priority-queued tasks;
    :Watchdog-monitored supervisor oversees retransmission and recovery processes;
    repeat while(Successful completion) is(no)
    :Employ exponential backoff strategy;
    :Persistent communication faults;
  else (no)
  end if
else (no)
end if

:All event traces adhere to DO-178C/DO-254 processes;
:Critical anomalies activate fault-tolerant strategies;
:Initiate prioritized data uplink to ground station via CRC-protected CAN bus;

:Flush ring buffer asynchronously to non-volatile memory within I/O budget constraints managed by PMIC/BMS;

stop

@enduml
